  "prefLabel": "Pda 502.25 Shorefront property mooring",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 502.25 “Shorefront property mooring” means a mooring permitted by the division pursuant to Pda 500 within a shorefront property mooring area and owned by a shorefront property owner.\n\nSource. #7940, eff 8-23-03; renumbered by #8775 (from Pda 502.25); ss by #9975, eff 8-20-11 (formerly Pda 502.28) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Pda 500); ss by #12958, eff 12-24-19",
